		["{npc:7311}, one of {zone:1454}'s mage trainers, gives it; so do {npc:4567} in the {zone:1458} and {npc:3047} in {zone:1456}."] = "{zone:1454}的法师训练师之一{npc:7311}会给你这个任务；{zone:1458}的{npc:4567}和{zone:1456}的{npc:3047}也会。",
