		["enemy players and finish the Field of Honor week 4 journey quest"] = "敌对玩家，并完成荣誉战场第4周的旅程任务",
		["enemy players and finish the Field of Honor week 7 journey quest"] = "敌对玩家，并完成荣誉战场第7周的旅程任务",
